---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { SITE_URL } from '../../data/site-config';
import { route } from '../../i18n/routes';
import { breadcrumbSchema } from '../../lib/seo';
import { t } from '../../i18n/ui';
const lang = 'en';
const code = `<iframe src="${SITE_URL}/embed/coin-value-checker/" title="Coin value checker" width="100%" height="760" style="border:0;max-width:1000px" loading="lazy"></iframe>`;
const code2 = `<iframe src="${SITE_URL}/embed/melt-value-calculator/" title="Melt value calculator" width="100%" height="700" style="border:0;max-width:1000px" loading="lazy"></iframe>`;
const code3 = `<iframe src="${SITE_URL}/embed/coin-grading-quiz/" title="Coin grading quiz" width="100%" height="760" style="border:0;max-width:1000px" loading="lazy"></iframe>`;
---
<PageLayout title="Embed the free coin value checker on your website" description="Put the coin value checker, the melt value calculator or the grading quiz on your website, club page or class blog: one iframe, no sign-up, no tracking, no cookie and no cost." lang={lang} noindex={true} jsonLd={[breadcrumbSchema([{ name: t(lang).breadcrumbHome, path: route('home', lang) }, { name: 'Embed', path: route('widget', lang) }])]} breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Embed' }]} showAuthor={false}>
  <header class="mb-6">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-navy-900 md:text-4xl">Embed a coin tool</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-lg text-navy-700">For coin clubs, libraries, teachers and blogs that help people sort the coins they find.</p>
  </header>
  <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">
    <h2>Coin value checker</h2>
    <pre class="overflow-x-auto rounded-lg bg-navy-900 p-4 text-sm text-white"><code>{code}</code></pre>
    <h2>Melt value calculator</h2>
    <pre class="overflow-x-auto rounded-lg bg-navy-900 p-4 text-sm text-white"><code>{code2}</code></pre>
    <h2>Coin grading quiz</h2>
    <pre class="overflow-x-auto rounded-lg bg-navy-900 p-4 text-sm text-white"><code>{code3}</code></pre>
    <p>Conditions: keep the credit line under the frame visible and use the tool as it is, without warranty. When a price or a figure changes, the embedded tool updates itself. Nothing your visitors type reaches us and the frame sets no cookie; the only outside request is the browser asking a public price service for the silver and copper price. Each frame states that the site is independent and not the United States Mint, a dealer or a grading service. Questions: <a href={route('contact', lang)}>contact</a>.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="mt-8 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-navy-200"><iframe src="/embed/coin-value-checker/" title="Coin value checker" width="100%" height="760" style="border:0" loading="lazy"></iframe></div>
</PageLayout>
